      "extra_snippets": [
        "Hegel was influenced in particular by Winckelmann, Kant and Schiller, and his own thesis of the \u201cend of art\u201d (or what has been taken to be that thesis) has itself been the focus of close attention by Heidegger and Adorno. Hegel\u2019s philosophy of art is a wide ranging account of beauty in art, the historical development of art, and the individual arts of architecture, sculpture, painting, music and poetry.",
